%SIXMD 1
# @?CP - COPY FILES

## @?OPERANDS

### @?SOURCE
REGULAR WORD-STREAM FILE TO READ.

### @?DESTINATION
FILE TO CREATE OR TRUNCATE AND REPLACE WITH SOURCE CONTENTS.

## DESCRIPTION

CP COPIES ONE REGULAR FILE AS A 36-BIT WORD STREAM.  IT DOES NOT PERFORM
CHARACTER-SET OR TEXT CONVERSION.
USAGE IS 'CP SOURCE DESTINATION'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
